        {
            "title": "油價反覆微升 全周累瀉逾一成",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">市場密切關注中東局勢發展，國際油價走勢反覆，收市微升，但全星期合計雙雙錄得一成多跌幅。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"油價 oil price\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/Oil_source-ap_-4.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"油價 oil price\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/01/Oil_source-ap_-4.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">油價 oil price</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約期油12月合約主要在90美元水平爭持，收報每桶90.83美元，上升0.3%。兩大指標期油合約全周結算均累挫逾一成。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">倫敦布蘭特期油1月合約盤中走勢大幅波動，曾重返每桶100美元關口，高見100.83美元，升幅接近3%，其後亦曾一度倒跌近2%，最終微升3美仙，收報每桶98.32美元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17134100-%e6%b2%b9%e5%83%b9%e5%8f%8d%e8%a6%86%e5%be%ae%e5%8d%87-%e5%85%a8%e5%91%a8%e7%b4%af%e7%80%89%e9%80%be%e4%b8%80%e6%88%90",
