        {
            "title": "歐股收跌   德股跌逾1.9%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">歐洲股市受壓，三大指數全線低收，法蘭克福股市跌幅最大。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">歐股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">泛歐指數Stoxx 600收市滑落1%，報648點，最多曾挫1.92%，為連跌第2日，本周累計升0.24%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">德國DAX指數收報25,820點，跌504點，跌幅1.92%，為區內跌幅最大主要市場。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英國富時100指數收報10,673點，跌108點，跌幅1.01%；法國CAC指數收報8,139點，跌66點，跌幅0.81%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">全星期計，英股跌0.5%，德股升2點，法股升2.1%，德法股市均連升兩星期。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國10月非農業就業職位增加16.5萬個，遠高於市場預期；失業率報4.1%，低於預期的4.2%，加息預期升溫。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17134055-%e6%ad%90%e8%82%a1%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c-%e5%be%b7%e8%82%a1%e8%b7%8c%e9%80%be1-9",
